{"suttaId":"an10.13","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[71,72],"vripara":"13"},"segments":{"an10.13:0.3":"Saṃyojanasuttaṃ","an10.13:1.1":"“Dasayimāni, bhikkhave, saṃyojanāni.","an10.13:1.2":"Katamāni dasa?","an10.13:1.3":"Pañcorambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni, pañcuddhambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni.","an10.13:1.4":"Katamāni pañcorambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni?","an10.13:1.5":"Sakkāyadiṭṭhi, vicikicchā, sīlabbataparāmāso, kāmacchando, byāpādo – imāni pañcorambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni.","an10.13:2.1":"“Katamāni pañcuddhambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni?","an10.13:2.2":"Rūparāgo, arūparāgo, māno, uddhaccaṃ, avijjā – imāni pañcuddhambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni.","an10.13:2.4":"Imāni kho, bhikkhave, dasa saṃyojanānī”ti.","an10.13:2.5":"Tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":433,"to":433,"paras":[{"para":433,"vripara":"13-14","refs":["an10.13:1","an10.13:2"],"words":["orambhāgiyānī","uddhambhāgiyānī"],"lines":["13-14. Tatiye <b>orambhāgiyānī</b>ti heṭṭhābhāgiyāni.","<b>Uddhambhāgiyānī</b>ti uparibhāgiyāni.","Imasmiṃ sutte vaṭṭameva kathitaṃ.","Catutthe <b>khilavinibandhā</b> pañcakanipāte vitthāritāyeva.","<b>Ārohapariṇāhenā</b>ti dīghaputhulantena."],"lineRefs":[["an10.13:1"],["an10.13:1"],["an10.13:1"],["an10.13:1"],["an10.13:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
